{"code":0,"msg":"succ","request_id":"c0821e6acafb4659ab80841b76874b75","data":{"errmsg":"success","content_id":"49a8e56ba8198a49edabf8eaf0082690b31c","content_type":2,"content_url":"https:///resource/web/app/feeds/detail.html?id=49a8e56ba8198a49edabf8eaf0082690b31c","view_num":578,"pub_timestamp":"1704963249","title":"1월 11일 업데이트 개선사항","share_url":"https:///resource/web/app/landpage/?id=49a8e56ba8198a49edabf8eaf0082690b31c","content":"\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cdiv data-version=\"3.0.0\" data-hash=\"39f9e1a370467290ccb624a3c761c829\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"document\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"section\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[모바일\u0026amp;PC\u0026nbsp;공통\u0026nbsp;개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;프로덕트\u0026nbsp;08\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「정밀\u0026nbsp;사격」이\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명과\u0026nbsp;다른\u0026nbsp;대상에게\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;사용\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;수치가\u0026nbsp;여러번\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;대미지는\u0026nbsp;기존과\u0026nbsp;동일합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[대상\u0026nbsp;스킬]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;얀\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「일확천금」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;드레이크\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「드레이크\u0026nbsp;스페셜」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;루피\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「싱글\u0026nbsp;페이먼트」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;니힐리스타\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「번\u0026nbsp;아포칼립스」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;유니\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「BDG」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;프로덕트\u0026nbsp;12\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「행동\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;정밀\u0026nbsp;타격」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;시그널\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「이머전시\u0026nbsp;시그널」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;벨로타\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「트릭키\u0026nbsp;봄버」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;솔져\u0026nbsp;E.G.\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「이글\u0026nbsp;샷」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;솔린\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「나도\u0026nbsp;한다면\u0026nbsp;해!」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;아니스\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「핀\u0026nbsp;포인트\u0026nbsp;미사일」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;신\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「워드\u0026nbsp;오브\u0026nbsp;킬」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;바이퍼\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「스네이크\u0026nbsp;바이트」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;스노우\u0026nbsp;화이트\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;이노센트\u0026nbsp;데이즈\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「세븐스\u0026nbsp;드워프\u0026nbsp;V\u0026nbsp;\u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;VI」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;스노우\u0026nbsp;화이트\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「세븐스\u0026nbsp;드워프\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;V\u0026nbsp;\u0026amp;\u0026nbsp;VI」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;니힐리스타\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「메기도\u0026nbsp;플레임」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;전투에서\u0026nbsp;재도전\u0026nbsp;이후\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;사격\u0026nbsp;효과음이\u0026nbsp;어색하게\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;적\u0026nbsp;처치\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;발동하는\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;스킬의\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e회\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;에피넬\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「슈퍼\u0026nbsp;루키」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;하란\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「포식」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;체력이\u0026nbsp;증가될\u0026nbsp;때,\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;「체력이\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;이하」조건의\u0026nbsp;스킬이\u0026nbsp;발동되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e단,\u0026nbsp;실시간으로\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;조건을\u0026nbsp;체크하는\u0026nbsp;스킬의\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;영향이\u0026nbsp;없으며,\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;영향을\u0026nbsp;받는\u0026nbsp;캐릭터와\u0026nbsp;스킬은\u0026nbsp;다음과\u0026nbsp;같습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;비스킷\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「터그\u0026nbsp;놀이」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명과\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;일시\u0026nbsp;정지\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;확인\u0026nbsp;가능한\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명을\u0026nbsp;통일하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;└\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;효과는\u0026nbsp;변경되지\u0026nbsp;않습니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[변경\u0026nbsp;사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;기존:\u0026nbsp;풀\u0026nbsp;차지\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;▲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;변경:\u0026nbsp;차지\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;▲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;은화\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「준비\u0026nbsp;태세」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;얀\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「풍비박산」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;앨리스\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「힘나는\u0026nbsp;당근」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;N102\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「부상하는\u0026nbsp;기억」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;히메노\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「고스트」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;A2\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「출력\u0026nbsp;상승」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;홍련\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;흑영\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「화무십일홍\u0026nbsp;·\u0026nbsp;만개」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[변경\u0026nbsp;사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;기존:\u0026nbsp;풀\u0026nbsp;차지\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;배율\u0026nbsp;▲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;변경:\u0026nbsp;차지\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;배율\u0026nbsp;▲\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;애드미\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「응원의\u0026nbsp;손길」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;메어리\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「백의의\u0026nbsp;천사」의\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;설명을\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;순서에\u0026nbsp;맞게\u0026nbsp;조정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[기존]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e■\u0026nbsp;자신의\u0026nbsp;체력이\u0026nbsp;50%\u0026nbsp;이상이라면\u0026nbsp;아군\u0026nbsp;전체에게\u0026nbsp;[방어력\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;▲]\u0026nbsp;[n초\u0026nbsp;유지]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e■\u0026nbsp;아군\u0026nbsp;전체에게\u0026nbsp;[시전자의\u0026nbsp;최종\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;비례\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;회복]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[변경]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e■\u0026nbsp;아군\u0026nbsp;전체에게\u0026nbsp;[시전자의\u0026nbsp;최종\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;비례\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;회복]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e■\u0026nbsp;자신의\u0026nbsp;체력이\u0026nbsp;50%\u0026nbsp;이상이라면\u0026nbsp;아군\u0026nbsp;전체에게\u0026nbsp;[방어력\u0026nbsp;n%\u0026nbsp;▲]\u0026nbsp;[n초\u0026nbsp;유지]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003ePVP\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;비스킷\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「터그\u0026nbsp;놀이」의\u0026nbsp;무적\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;설명과\u0026nbsp;다른\u0026nbsp;대상에게\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003ePVP에서\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;효과로\u0026nbsp;최대\u0026nbsp;체력이\u0026nbsp;증가할\u0026nbsp;때,\u0026nbsp;증가한\u0026nbsp;만큼의\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;회복\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;2회\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;PVP\u0026nbsp;외\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠에서는\u0026nbsp;변동사항이\u0026nbsp;없습니다.\u0026nbsp;정상적인\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;진행에\u0026nbsp;불편함을\u0026nbsp;드려\u0026nbsp;죄송합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;폴크방\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「페이스\u0026nbsp;다운」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;델타\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「리콜렉션」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;프림\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「…아」\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;프림\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「…귀찮아」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;솔져\u0026nbsp;F.A.\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「팔콘\u0026nbsp;부스트」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;노이즈\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「싱잉\u0026nbsp;투게더」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;노이즈\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「에너제틱\u0026nbsp;노이즈」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;라푼젤\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「디바인\u0026nbsp;블레스」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;퀀시\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「위대한\u0026nbsp;탈출」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;소다\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「자리\u0026nbsp;청소\u0026nbsp;메이드」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;블랑\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「쇼타임」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;2B\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「생존\u0026nbsp;행동」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;티아\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「카멜레온\u0026nbsp;은신술」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e10.\u0026nbsp;적에게\u0026nbsp;[분배\u0026nbsp;대미지]가\u0026nbsp;발동할\u0026nbsp;때\u0026nbsp;순간적(1프레임\u0026nbsp;이내)으로\u0026nbsp;다른\u0026nbsp;공격의\u0026nbsp;대미지도\u0026nbsp;분배하는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[대상]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;도로시\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「세례」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;도로시\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「실낙원」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;2B\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;「연속\u0026nbsp;공격」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;PVP에서\u0026nbsp;마키마\u0026nbsp;스킬2\u0026nbsp;「발각된\u0026nbsp;모양이네」의\u0026nbsp;버스트\u0026nbsp;스킬의\u0026nbsp;재사용\u0026nbsp;시간\u0026nbsp;감소\u0026nbsp;효과가\u0026nbsp;2회\u0026nbsp;적용되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;아레나\u0026nbsp;외\u0026nbsp;콘텐츠에서는\u0026nbsp;변동사항이\u0026nbsp;없습니다.\u0026nbsp;다시한번,\u0026nbsp;정상적인\u0026nbsp;게임\u0026nbsp;진행에\u0026nbsp;불편함을\u0026nbsp;드려\u0026nbsp;죄송합니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e12.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e랩쳐\u0026nbsp;랜드이터의\u0026nbsp;코어\u0026nbsp;피격\u0026nbsp;범위를\u0026nbsp;확대하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e3\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e홍련\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;흑영\u0026nbsp;스킬1\u0026nbsp;「화무십일홍\u0026nbsp;·\u0026nbsp;파죽」의\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;설명\u0026nbsp;문구에\u0026nbsp;색상\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;용어\u0026nbsp;설명이\u0026nbsp;출력되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e14.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;홍련\u0026nbsp;:\u0026nbsp;흑영의\u0026nbsp;기본\u0026nbsp;공격\u0026nbsp;효과음이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"\"\u003e컨텐츠/시스템\u0026nbsp;관련\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e전초기지에서\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;보이스를\u0026nbsp;가지고\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;연속해서\u0026nbsp;선택할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;음성이\u0026nbsp;중첩되어\u0026nbsp;재생되는\u0026nbsp;현상\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;아카이브\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;Miracle\u0026nbsp;Snow의\u0026nbsp;필드\u0026nbsp;입장\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;카메라\u0026nbsp;연출이\u0026nbsp;어색한\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;아카이브의\u0026nbsp;Miracle\u0026nbsp;Snow\u0026nbsp;미니게임인\u0026nbsp;Gift\u0026nbsp;Factory에서\u0026nbsp;일시정지\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;BGM의\u0026nbsp;재생이\u0026nbsp;어색한\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;아카이브의\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;스테이지를\u0026nbsp;클리어한\u0026nbsp;직후\u0026nbsp;네트워크\u0026nbsp;연결에\u0026nbsp;문제가\u0026nbsp;발생할\u0026nbsp;경우,\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;앨범에\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;기록이\u0026nbsp;추가되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;아카이브의\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;[보너스\u0026nbsp;보상\u0026nbsp;니케]\u0026nbsp;버튼이\u0026nbsp;보이지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;PVP\u0026nbsp;전투\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;대미지\u0026nbsp;수치\u0026nbsp;대신\u0026nbsp;Immune\u0026nbsp;UI가\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;PVP\u0026nbsp;화면의\u0026nbsp;공격,\u0026nbsp;방어\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;글자가\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[기존]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;공격력\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;방어력\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[변경]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;공격\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;방어\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;스페셜\u0026nbsp;아레나의\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;다른\u0026nbsp;라운드에\u0026nbsp;배치된\u0026nbsp;니케가\u0026nbsp;최하단에\u0026nbsp;정렬되도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성이\u0026nbsp;비어있는\u0026nbsp;상태로\u0026nbsp;요격전의\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;빠른\u0026nbsp;전투가\u0026nbsp;가능한\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e10.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e캠페인\u0026nbsp;필드에서\u0026nbsp;서브\u0026nbsp;퀘스트\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시,\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;시나리오\u0026nbsp;기능\u0026nbsp;버튼이\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;표시되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정했습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e11\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;모바일\u0026nbsp;기기에서\u0026nbsp;타일런트급\u0026nbsp;랩쳐의\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;UI가\u0026nbsp;어색한\u0026nbsp;위치에\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e1\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e.\u0026nbsp;마스트\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;컷씬에\u0026nbsp;등장하는\u0026nbsp;모건의\u0026nbsp;날개\u0026nbsp;연출을\u0026nbsp;더욱\u0026nbsp;자연스러워\u0026nbsp;보이도록\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e13.\u0026nbsp;피격\u0026nbsp;횟수에\u0026nbsp;의해\u0026nbsp;처치되는\u0026nbsp;랩처의\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;게이지\u0026nbsp;바\u0026nbsp;연출이\u0026nbsp;어색한\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e14.\u0026nbsp;니케와\u0026nbsp;상당\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;상담\u0026nbsp;상세\u0026nbsp;화면으로\u0026nbsp;복귀할때\u0026nbsp;BGM이\u0026nbsp;일시적으로\u0026nbsp;어색하게\u0026nbsp;들리는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e15.\u0026nbsp;시뮬레이션\u0026nbsp;룸의\u0026nbsp;버프\u0026nbsp;레거시\u0026nbsp;초기화\u0026nbsp;주기가\u0026nbsp;변경되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[기존]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003eㄴ매일\u0026nbsp;05:00:00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e[변경]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003eㄴ격주\u0026nbsp;화요일\u0026nbsp;05:00:00\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e주기\u0026nbsp;변경\u0026nbsp;이후,\u0026nbsp;최초\u0026nbsp;초기화\u0026nbsp;일정은\u0026nbsp;1월\u0026nbsp;16일(화요일)\u0026nbsp;05:00:00\u0026nbsp;입니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e16.\u0026nbsp;아레나\u0026nbsp;및\u0026nbsp;스페셜\u0026nbsp;아레나의\u0026nbsp;공격,\u0026nbsp;방어\u0026nbsp;스쿼드\u0026nbsp;편성\u0026nbsp;글자가\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e17.\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;꾸미기에\u0026nbsp;랜덤\u0026nbsp;출력\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;진입할\u0026nbsp;때마다\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\u0026quot;Arial\u0026quot;\"\u003e설정된\u0026nbsp;스탠딩,\u0026nbsp;이벤트,\u0026nbsp;스킬\u0026nbsp;컷씬\u0026nbsp;중에서\u0026nbsp;무작위로\u0026nbsp;출력됩니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"\"\u003e18.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e유니온\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;큐브\u0026nbsp;배터리\u0026nbsp;구매\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;하모니큐브\u0026nbsp;강화에\u0026nbsp;필요한\u0026nbsp;수량이\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e19.\u0026nbsp;전초기지의\u0026nbsp;겨울\u0026nbsp;테마가\u0026nbsp;기본\u0026nbsp;테마로\u0026nbsp;변경되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e기타\u0026nbsp;개선사항：\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;체\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e력\u0026nbsp;게이지\u0026nbsp;바\u0026nbsp;표현이\u0026nbsp;실제\u0026nbsp;체력\u0026nbsp;수치와\u0026nbsp;좀\u0026nbsp;더\u0026nbsp;명확하게\u0026nbsp;동기화되도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;캐시\u0026nbsp;상점에서\u0026nbsp;상품\u0026nbsp;구매\u0026nbsp;중\u0026nbsp;네트워크\u0026nbsp;연결에\u0026nbsp;문제가\u0026nbsp;발생할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;보여지는\u0026nbsp;안내가\u0026nbsp;문제\u0026nbsp;상황과\u0026nbsp;일치하도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;상황에서\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;영상의\u0026nbsp;일시정지\u0026nbsp;버튼이\u0026nbsp;계속\u0026nbsp;재생되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e4.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Arial\"\u003e대원모집\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;쥬얼\u0026nbsp;상점,\u0026nbsp;마일리지\u0026nbsp;상점,\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;상세보기로\u0026nbsp;이동\u0026nbsp;후\u0026nbsp;복귀할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;대원모집\u0026nbsp;화면\u0026nbsp;상단의\u0026nbsp;재화\u0026nbsp;아이콘이\u0026nbsp;잘못\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e5.\u0026nbsp;대원모집\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;진행\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;전용\u0026nbsp;BGM이\u0026nbsp;재생되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e6.\u0026nbsp;대원모집\u0026nbsp;화면에서\u0026nbsp;다른\u0026nbsp;화면으로\u0026nbsp;이동할\u0026nbsp;때,\u0026nbsp;BGM이\u0026nbsp;어색하게\u0026nbsp;출력되는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e7.\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;꾸미기에서\u0026nbsp;「힘내라!\u0026nbsp;미카!」\u0026nbsp;월페이퍼\u0026nbsp;설정\u0026nbsp;시\u0026nbsp;로비에서\u0026nbsp;낮은\u0026nbsp;확률로\u0026nbsp;난간이\u0026nbsp;깜빡이는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e8.\u0026nbsp;회상\u0026nbsp;화면에\u0026nbsp;진입할\u0026nbsp;때\u0026nbsp;로딩\u0026nbsp;화면이\u0026nbsp;표시되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e9.\u0026nbsp;기간이\u0026nbsp;만료된\u0026nbsp;패스의\u0026nbsp;배너를\u0026nbsp;선택할\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;안내\u0026nbsp;메시지\u0026nbsp;출력과\u0026nbsp;함께\u0026nbsp;화면이\u0026nbsp;갱신되도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e10.\u0026nbsp;주크박스\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;음악\u0026nbsp;제목의\u0026nbsp;오타를\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[기존]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;Camilla\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[변경]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;Camellia\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e11.\u0026nbsp;시나리오가\u0026nbsp;포함된\u0026nbsp;유실물에\u0026nbsp;다시\u0026nbsp;보기\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e12.\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;정렬하는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;개선되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;니케\u0026nbsp;이름\u0026nbsp;검색\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;레드닷이\u0026nbsp;활성화된\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;정렬하는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;스토리\u0026nbsp;이벤트\u0026nbsp;보너스\u0026nbsp;보상\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;우선\u0026nbsp;정렬하는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e└\u0026nbsp;일부\u0026nbsp;불필요한\u0026nbsp;UI\u0026nbsp;버튼이\u0026nbsp;제거되었습니다\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e13.\u0026nbsp;로비\u0026nbsp;꾸미기의\u0026nbsp;기업\u0026nbsp;필터를\u0026nbsp;한\u0026nbsp;가지만\u0026nbsp;선택할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e14.대원모집\u0026nbsp;위시리스트\u0026nbsp;슬롯에\u0026nbsp;포함된\u0026nbsp;니케를\u0026nbsp;쉽게\u0026nbsp;교체할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있도록\u0026nbsp;개선하였습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\"\u003e15.\u0026nbsp;코스튬\u0026nbsp;가챠\u0026nbsp;연출을\u0026nbsp;스킵할\u0026nbsp;수\u0026nbsp;있는\u0026nbsp;기능이\u0026nbsp;추가되었습니다.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e[PC\u0026nbsp;개선사항]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"default\"\u003e1.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;환경에서\u0026nbsp;간헐적으로\u0026nbsp;게임이\u0026nbsp;실행되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e2.\u0026nbsp;특정\u0026nbsp;PC\u0026nbsp;환경에서\u0026nbsp;스텝업\u0026nbsp;모집\u0026nbsp;이미지의\u0026nbsp;중앙\u0026nbsp;부분이\u0026nbsp;까맣게\u0026nbsp;보이는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003e3.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan data-font-family=\"Malgun Gothic\"\u003eWindows\u0026nbsp;언어\u0026nbsp;설정이\u0026nbsp;터키어일\u0026nbsp;경우\u0026nbsp;게임이\u0026nbsp;정상적으로\u0026nbsp;실행되지\u0026nbsp;않는\u0026nbsp;현상을\u0026nbsp;수정하였습니다.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/body\u003e","spider_score":"-999","pic_urls":["https://na-nikke-aws.playerinfinite.com/cms/nrft/feeds/pic/_cd5908cc6d51b6883819a910e2df8de5f3e6f202-1200x675-ori_s_80_50_ori_q_80.jpeg"],"ext_info":"{\"template_id\":\"\"}","jump_link":{},"content_desc":"1월 11일 업데이트 개선사항","primary_label_ids":[308,309],"secondary_label_ids":[494,892],"content_part":"[모바일\u0026PC 공통 개선사항]\n전투 관련 개선사항：\n1. 프로덕트 08 스킬2 「정밀 사격」이 스킬 설명과 다른 대상에게 적용되는 현상을 수정하였습니다. \n2. 일부 스킬 사용 시, 특정 상황에서 대미지 수치가 여러번 출력되는 현상을 수정하였습니다. \n└ 실제 대미지는 기존과 동일합니다.\n[대상 스킬]\n└ 얀 버스트 스킬 「일확천금」\n└ 드레이크 버스트 스킬 「드레이크 스페셜」\n└ 루피 버스트 스킬 「싱글 페이먼트」\n└ 니힐리스타 버스트 스킬 「번 아포칼립스」\n└ 유니 버스트 스킬 「BDG」\n└ 프로덕트 12 버스트 스킬 「행동 : 정밀 타격」\n└ 시그널 버스트 스킬 「이머전시 시그널」\n└ 벨로타 버스트 스킬 「트릭키 봄버」\n└ 솔져 E.G. 버스트 스킬 「이글 샷」\n└ 솔린 버스트 스킬 「나도 한다면 해!」\n└ 아니스 버스트 스킬 「핀 포인트 미사일」\n└ 신 버스트 스킬 「워드 오브 킬」\n└ 바이퍼 버스트 스킬 「스네이크 바이트」\n└ 스노우 화이트 : 이노센트 데이즈 스킬1 「세븐","language":"ko","father_content_id":"49a8e56ba8198a49edabf8eaf0082690b31c","result":0}}